# Tailscale Operator

## Procedure

Configure Tailscale only for services that require private ingress.

## Verify

Confirm the intended service has a reachable private endpoint and no unintended
public exposure.

## Troubleshooting

Check operator health, service annotations, DNS, and NetworkPolicy.

OAuth bootstrap distinguishes an absent Secret from an unavailable API by a
successful exact-name Secret collection lookup. The operator credential therefore
needs namespace Secret `list` permission, not only named `get`. An existing Secret
is left untouched; lookup/validation or Secret-apply failure stops the installation.
See [deployment observation failures](setup-flow.md#deployment-and-cleanup-observation-failures)
for permissions, diagnostics, rerun behavior and the limits of local fixture tests.
